[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15900.389, "timestamp": "04:25:00", "text": "神啊，伊什玛，毁灭我吧。是的。你……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15902.55, "timestamp": "04:25:02", "text": "知道凌晨3点会有夜雨吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15906.07, "timestamp": "04:25:06", "text": "什么是夜雨？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15909.149, "timestamp": "04:25:09", "text": "我认为是长老。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15912.71, "timestamp": "04:25:12", "text": "戒指。就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15915.309, "timestamp": "04:25:15", "text": "长老环。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15920.469, "timestamp": "04:25:20", "text": "是的。长老环夜行列车。哦，那个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15924.71, "timestamp": "04:25:24", "text": "游戏。某物。这只是一场游戏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15927.11, "timestamp": "04:25:27", "text": "该死。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15929.03, "timestamp": "04:25:29", "text": "我没有钱，否则我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15931.229, "timestamp": "04:25:31", "text": "本来会玩的。但它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15934.389, "timestamp": "04:25:34", "text": "好的。一切都好。我们无法播放它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15937.03, "timestamp": "04:25:37", "text": "日本。我猜过不了多久，就没了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15939.63, "timestamp": "04:25:39", "text": "几年，几个月。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15942.55, "timestamp": "04:25:42", "text": "是的。我会努力工作"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15945.11, "timestamp": "04:25:45", "text": "一切就绪后，我将使用备用的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15948.67, "timestamp": "04:25:48", "text": "可以用来买游戏之类的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15951.189, "timestamp": "04:25:51", "text": "是的。我的天啊。我必须改变我的"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 15951.295, "timestamp": "04:25:51", "author": "@Roku-rin", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/8LlS_C2IirDMfA5r2V0q5G1kudp8dmG6RQvz_jCAUT3H-esyEgTNPDwrfCXiyX7Undc9UmHNgw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "GG"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15955.03, "timestamp": "04:25:55", "text": "现在Steam商店之类的东西也都有了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15956.349, "timestamp": "04:25:56", "text": "哦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15959.389, "timestamp": "04:25:59", "text": "男生。你好，阿里。谢谢。"}]